  <constraints>
    <constraint source="wire-dont-rebuild">The endpoints (050–054) and reanchor components (054) are correct — CONNECT them, do NOT rewrite. Verify a route exists before adding one (Component Justification §11).</constraint>
    <constraint source="owner-config-boundary">Do NOT attempt to provision Compose:Webhook:* Key Vault secrets (that is DEF-03 / task 056, owner/live-env). Name it. The webhook-delivery leg is ✅◐ E2E-pending on it; wire + test the POLL path instead (no secrets needed).</constraint>
    <constraint source="no-fold-055">Do NOT build task 055 (deterministic push/save orchestration + Tier-2c preview) here — it is a separate 🔲 task. Leave the seam consumable.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-007">SPE reads/writes + subscription go through the SpeFileStore / SpeSyncOrchestrator facade; no Microsoft.Graph types leak into Services/Compose.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-030">Any bus signal for the reanchor/return-from-Word flow uses a typed discriminant (from PaneEventTypes.ts) — zero `as any`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="cleanGuid">Any Xrm-sourced GUID entering an @odata.bind or /entityset(guid) URL is wrapped with cleanGuid from @spaarke/ui-components. SPE ids / drive ids in JSON bodies are not OData URLs and are not wrapped.</constraint>
    <constraint source="no-defer">Close the wiring gaps 3.1/3.2/3.4/3.5 in this pass; do NOT file deferrals for them. (3.3 config = owner task 056; 3.6 = task 055 — both already tracked, not new deferrals.)</constraint>
