    <criterion testable="true">A pull-annotations client caller exists (gap 3.4 closed); the 054 reanchor banner/panel is mounted in ComposeWorkspace and the poll check-changes path drives the change signal (gap 3.5 closed).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A WebApplicationFactory test drives the poll path (check-changes → reanchor) through the real routes in-process and asserts a detected change reanchors (anti-recurrence definition-of-done for the testable leg).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Task 056 (webhook Key Vault config / DEF-03) + task 055 (deterministic orchestration) are NAMED as owner-queued / separate-sequenced; the webhook-delivery leg is marked ✅◐ E2E-pending on 056; no silent deferral of in-scope wiring. Zero `as any`; typed discriminants; no route rewritten. Publish-size + CVE reported; Step 9.5 clean.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

